{"id":"cfab19be26256e46","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-dovf.md","title":"DOVF (Dense Orders Without the Finiteness Condition)","display":"df-dovf — DOVF (Dense Orders Without the Finiteness Condition)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-dovf","aliases":["57-df-dovf"],"display":"df-dovf — DOVF (Dense Orders Without the Finiteness Condition)","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-dovf-signature]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-dovf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-dovf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dovf — DOVF (Dense Orders Without the Finiteness Condition)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8796293a4aee661\" href=\"?note=c8796293a4aee661\" title=\"57-df-dovf-signature\">57-df-dovf-signature</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Densely-Ordered-Vector-Spaces-Without-the-Finiteness-Condition\">Densely Ordered Vector Spaces Without the Finiteness Condition</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak V\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{dovf}})\">\\(\\mathfrak V\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{dovf}})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=|\\mathfrak V|\">\\(V=|\\mathfrak V|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_V=&lt;^{\\mathfrak V}\">\\(&lt;_V=&lt;^{\\mathfrak V}\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c8796293a4aee661\" href=\"?note=c8796293a4aee661\" title=\"57-df-dovf-signature\">57-df-dovf-signature</a>。</li>\n<li>固定一个集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>、关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\subseteq D^2\">\\(\\prec\\subseteq D^2\\)</span> 和函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:V\\to D\">\\(\\nu:V\\to D\\)</span> 作为本定义的环境参数。原式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\vec v|\">\\(|\\vec v|\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(\\vec v)\">\\(\\nu(\\vec v)\\)</span>，量值间的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec v,\\vec w,\\vec u\">\\(\\vec v,\\vec w,\\vec u\\)</span> 在这里都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的元素，不是额外引入的有限列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DOVF}(\\mathfrak V)\">\\(\\mathrm{DOVF}(\\mathfrak V)\\)</span> 保留一元调用；改变 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D,\\prec,\\nu)\">\\((D,\\prec,\\nu)\\)</span> 时必须改变环境实例。不从标题推断未提供的向量空间或范数公理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n|\\vec v|&amp;\\coloneqq\\nu(\\vec v),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DOVF}(\\mathfrak V)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec v,\\vec w\\in V\\\n\\Bigl(\\nu(\\vec v)\\prec\\nu(\\vec w)\\longrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec u\\in V\\ (\\nu(\\vec u)=\\nu(\\vec v)\\land\\vec v&lt;_V\\vec u\\land\\vec u&lt;_V\\vec w)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n|\\vec v|&amp;\\coloneqq\\nu(\\vec v),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DOVF}(\\mathfrak V)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec v,\\vec w\\in V\\\n\\Bigl(\\nu(\\vec v)\\prec\\nu(\\vec w)\\longrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec u\\in V\\ (\\nu(\\vec u)=\\nu(\\vec v)\\land\\vec v&lt;_V\\vec u\\land\\vec u&lt;_V\\vec w)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原条件，不把它替换成另一种标准稠密序或有序向量空间定义。给定文本没有决定竖线的具体含义；这里只显式化该必要参数，未擅自选择维数、长度或范数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Densely-Ordered-Vector-Spaces-Without-the-Finiteness-Condition","text":"Densely Ordered Vector Spaces Without the Finiteness Condition","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-dovf-signature","status":"resolved","id":"c8796293a4aee661","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-dovf-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak V\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{dovf}})$，$V=|\\mathfrak V|$，$<_V=<^{\\mathfrak V}$；见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-dovf-signature]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-dovf-signature","status":"resolved","id":"c8796293a4aee661","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak V\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{dovf}})$，$V=|\\mathfrak V|$，$<_V=<^{\\mathfrak V}$；见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-dovf-signature]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak V\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{dovf}})","display":false},{"tex":"V=|\\mathfrak V|","display":false},{"tex":"<_V=<^{\\mathfrak V}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec\\subseteq D^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu:V\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"|\\vec v|","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(\\vec v)","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec v,\\vec w,\\vec u","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DOVF}(\\mathfrak V)","display":false},{"tex":"(D,\\prec,\\nu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n|\\vec v|&\\coloneqq\\nu(\\vec v),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DOVF}(\\mathfrak V)&\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec v,\\vec w\\in V\\\n\\Bigl(\\nu(\\vec v)\\prec\\nu(\\vec w)\\longrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec u\\in V\\ (\\nu(\\vec u)=\\nu(\\vec v)\\land\\vec v<_V\\vec u\\land\\vec u<_V\\vec w)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1501,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[57-df-derivable]]\n[[57-df-derivation]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-dlo]]\n[[57-df-dnf]]\n[[57-df-domain]]\n[[57-df-dovf]]\n[[57-df-dovf-signature]]\n[[57-df-downward-LS-property]]\n[[57-df-dpll]]\n[[57-df-ef-game]]\n[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]\n[[57-df-equality-left]]\n[[57-df-equality-right]]\n[[57-df-equiv-left]]\n[[57